      "message": "wip(cl): first-traverse law and v4 stamp fallout (WIP, not gated)\n\nHeld work for #2901. Adds the first-traverse law\n(sim::verify::first_traverse_low, Warning::FirstTraverseLow) and its\napp seam (operation::first_traverse), the pins in\ncrates/app/tests/first_traverse.rs, the decision file, the regenerated\nexample projects, the CL START goldens and the changed test\nexpectations. Not gated: a full red list is still owed.\n\nRefs #2901\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
