        "date": "2026-11-20T15:08:34Z"
      },
      "message": "docs(site): guide counts and troubleshooting for the first-traverse law\n\nThe regenerated guide-multiaxis project changes its cached warnings:\nIndexed Face1 now has 30 gouge and 1 first-traverse-low warnings, and\nSwarf1 has 884 shank hits (was 897). The site test and the two guide\npages beside the images state the new counts; the indexed page explains\nthe clearance verdict. The troubleshooting page drops the false advice\nto face the stock first for a clearance plane inside the stock, and gets\nan entry for the new refusal: its text, its meaning and its fix.\n\nRefs #2901\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
